:: Office Secretary Party Drink Decline
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I'm not thirsty, thanks," you say to the <<person2>><<person>>, holding your hands close so <<he>> does not press the cup on you.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"No, thank you," you say, soft but firm enough to refuse the drink.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I'm not thirsty, thanks," you say to the <<person2>><<person>>, giving <<him>> a polite smile.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'm good," you say, waving the cup away before it gets too close.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Pass," you say, eyeing the drink before looking back at the snacks.
<<else>>
	"I'm not thirsty, thanks," you say to the <<person2>><<person>>.
<</if>>
<<He>> shrugs and walks away to talk to another attendee. You hang out a bit longer, enjoying the celebration. Someone announces that they will cut the cake soon.
<br><br>
<<link [[케이크를 먹기 위해 남는다 |Office Secretary Party Continue]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[일하러 돌아간다|Office Secretary Party Leave]]>><</link>>

:: Office Secretary Party Continue
<<effects>>
당신은 케이크를 먹기 위해 남기로 한다.
<br>
<<if $partyDrugged is 1>>
	<<set $partyDrugged to 0>>
	<<drugs 150>>
	When it's your turn to get your cake, you start to feel a bit woozy. The room tilts with the scrape of chairs and office chatter, and you sit down before your knees can betray you. You try to steady yourself with a bite of cake, but the sweetness turns thick in your mouth, and soon you find yourself passing out.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[다음|Office Secretary Party Molest]]>><<pass 15>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	케이크는 부드럽고, 프로스팅은 너무 달지 않다. 당신은 한 조각을 다 먹고 일을 마치기 위해 돌아간다. 책상에 다시 앉은 직후, <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 돌아온다.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|Office Secretary Finish]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Office Secretary Party Leave
<<effects>>
당신은 <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 돌아오기 전에 일하러 돌아가야겠다고 결심한다.
<<if $partyDrugged is 1>>
	<<set $partyDrugged to 0>>
	<<drugs 150>>
	While heading back to the desk, you start to feel a bit woozy. The corridor seems longer than it should, each office light smearing at the edge of your vision. You stop to try and get your bearings, but soon find yourself passing out.
	<<endevent>>
	<<if playerMayBeSpiked()>>
		<<xchange-random-spike "suppress">><<xchange-seen 2>>
		<br><br>
		<<if xchangeSpikeChangedBody()>>
			Your body starts to change as your vision fades. That wasn't just alcohol. <span class="pink">Someone spiked your drink with an unknown pill.</span>
		<<else>>
			You suddenly feel hot and dizzy as your vision fades. That wasn't just alcohol. <span class="pink">Someone spiked your drink with an unknown pill.</span>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<officepassout>>
<<else>>
	당신은 책상으로 돌아와 파일 정리를 마치고, 바로 그때 <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 도착한다.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|Office Secretary Finish]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

